Maintainer: John-Michael Mulesa <jmulesa@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl, ca-certificates, icoutils, unzip
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://www.velanstudios.com/games?game=knockout-city
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: knockoutcity-server
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: gamelaunch, hicolor-icon-theme, postgresql, valkey-server | redis-server, python3, ${pt:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Knockout City Private Server Edition dedicated server, using Wine
 Velan Studios' Private Hosted Server for Knockout City (version 10.0), run
 through gamelaunch with a private per-user PostgreSQL and Valkey/Redis. Also
 provides the `knockoutcity` launcher used by the knockoutcity-wine and
 knockoutcity-wine-steam client packages: host a game on this PC, or pick a
 server announced on the LAN.
